	quest.210CCD2E50E927D6.quest_desc: ["A CPU only fits a mainboard with its &fsocket&r, and the RAM must match the board's &fmemory generation&r (SDRAM, DDR, DDR2 ... DDR5).", "", "Every CPU socket has a real board from the day its first CPU comes out. Mining boards carry up to 19 graphics cards."]
	quest.210CCD2E50E927D6.title: "The right mainboard"
	quest.222027F73A08570E.quest_desc: ["The &fPowered Server Room Panel&r seals a server room like any wall block and carries &fFE&r straight through.", "Place it in the wall and connect a cable or battery on each side."]
	quest.222027F73A08570E.title: "Power through the wall"
	quest.2269FBB31582DFEF.quest_desc: ["A switch ends every cable run plugged into it. From then on each run counts &fon its own&r: it carries the traffic of its own devices, and the switch's &fbackplane&r limits the total.", "", "&aA star beats a chain:&r give each rack its own cable to the switch.", "Switches also reset the cable reach."]
	quest.2269FBB31582DFEF.title: "A real switch"
