	quest.29C231E37B49246A.quest_desc: ["Every switch draws its &freal wattage&r in FE per tick, e.g. 30 FE/t for a Catalyst 2950 and 700 FE/t for a Spectrum SN4700.", "", "&cA switch without power cuts its network.&r Its status LED blinks red, and the Hosting Manager warns you about it.", "Turn it off under &7Config → Network → Switches Need Power&r."]
